{"type":"Film","id":"FR2016_027","slug":"fr2016-027-les-naufrages","title":{"native":"Les Naufragés","english":"Shipwrecked"},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2016-02-17","year":2016},"filmType":"Fiction film","directors":[{"id":"David Charhon","slug":"david-charhon","name":"David Charhon","birthYear":1972,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]}],"genre":["Comedy","Adventure"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/58/99/156474/format_page/les-naufrages.jpg","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MAAkw4P0vH4"},"synopsis":{"native":"Jean-Louis Brochard, escroc de la finance en fuite et William Boulanger, teinturier cocu tout juste quitté par sa femme, échouent sur une île déserte après un crash d’avion. Les deux naufragés, incapable de cohabiter, vont essayer de fuir cet enfer en espérant ne jamais se revoir. Mais l’île, pas aussi déserte qu’il n’y paraît, leur réservera une surprise qui les liera à tout jamais.","english":"Jean-Louis Brochard, a financial swindler who has fled France, and William Boulanger, a dry cleaner who has been jilted by his wife, find themselves marooned on a desert island after their plane is forced to crash land. Incapable of helping one another, the two castaways attempt to escape from this godforsaken place, hoping never to set eyes on each other again. But the island is not as deserted as it first appears, and has a surprise in store for them that will bond them forever."},"production":[{"country":"France","share":"Majority coproducer"},{"country":"Belgium","share":"Minority coproducer"}],"characters":[{"id":"FR2016_027_01","film":"FR2016_027","person":{"id":"Daniel Auteuil","slug":"daniel-auteuil","name":"Daniel Auteuil","birthYear":1950,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[{"film":{"slug":"fr2019-181-la-belle-epoque","title":{"native":"La Belle Époque"}},"year":2020,"award":"César du cinéma","category":"Best Actor Male","